  "desc": "A laid-back RolandTR505 kit floating in room reverb: skeletal kick/snare that alternates its footprint every other bar, breathy pumped hats panning against an opposite-phase filter breath, off-beat open hats that nudge late at phrase ends and an every-8 double-time fill. Macintosh-Plus haze drums, behind the beat.",
